Sugrīva dispatches Suṣēṇa west with hundred thousand monkeys --- Monkeys search cities Kētaka thickets rivers hermitages tirelessly --- Monkeys reach timi-crocodile ocean seeking Sītā and Rāvaṇa --- Monkeys scan ports Hēmagiri winged lions and golden sea-mound --- Monkeys avoid fierce fruit-guarding Gandharvas taking nothing --- Monkeys search Cakravān Varāha Prāgjyōtiṣa Varuṇa Mēru abodes --- Monkeys greet sunlike Mērusāvarṇi seeking Maithilī tidings --- Monkeys must return within month on pain of death
